    F --> H
    H --> I{Are errors present?}
    I -->|Yes| J[End System Processes]
    I -->|No| K[Decrease Room Temperature]
    J --> G
    K --> G
```

### Conclusion:
The analysis indicates that the processor temperature is primarily influenced by the system load and fan speed. To maintain optimal temperatures, it is essential to monitor and manage these factors effectively. Regular checks and adjustments can help prevent overheating and ensure stable performance.

